              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5000",
              "path": ["api", "substitutions", "generate"]
            },
            "description": "Triggers the priority engine to generate substitutions for the given date.\n\nThe engine:\n1. Identifies all teachers absent by the cut-off time\n2. Collects their vacant periods\n3. Sorts by class priority (Board years first)\n4. Scores eligible substitutes and assigns the best matches"
          },
          "response": []
