            "description": "Step 5: Trigger the auto-substitution engine at 8:30 AM cut-off.\n\nThe engine will:\n1. Identify T001 and T011 as absent\n2. Find all their vacant periods for Tuesday\n3. Sort vacancies by class priority (12A first, then 10B, 9A, 8C)\n4. Score eligible substitutes using the 5-factor algorithm\n5. Assign best matches while respecting daily cap (max 2 per teacher)"
          },
          "response": []
