              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "5000",
              "path": ["api", "substitutions", "today"]
            },
            "description": "Step 6: View the generated substitution circular.\n\nExpect to see substitution records for every vacant period of T001 and T011, each with:\n- The assigned substitute teacher\n- Match type (exact_subject / allied_subject / available_teacher)\n- Score and reasoning\n- Full candidate audit trail"
          },
          "response": []
